# Greybox 2D Platformer Art Bible

Generator credit: Greybox + Kai Designer. AI-assisted, human-directed.

## Pillars

- Readable jumps before expressive jumps.
- Hazards telegraph one beat before punishment.
- The first screen teaches movement, collection, and danger without text.

## Palette

- Sky Paper: #D8E8FF
- Runner Ink: #1A1A1F
- Platform Moss: #2ECC71
- Checkpoint Spark: #FF6B35
- Hazard Crit: #E94B3C
- Coin Focus: #F4C95D

## Materials

Use matte platform materials with subtle bevels. Enemies should carry high-contrast
silhouettes and one Spark Orange accent only when they are interactable.
